<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
    <meta name="CRM" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>CRM - System</title>
</head>
<style>
   
    html, body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        border: 0;
        outline: 0;
    }

    html {
        font-size: 85%;
        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0,0,0,0)
    }

    body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Arial, Sans-Serif;
        color: #333;
        background: #f1f1f1;
    }

    .container {
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
        width: 960px;
        background-color: #549cba;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 30px;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 0 0 10px;
        font-weight: normal;
        border-bottom: solid 1px #fff;
        margin-top: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    a {
        color: #fff;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

        a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

</style>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>
            Maintenance
        </h1>
        <p>
            CRM is currently unavailable due to scheduled maintenance.<br />
            This downtime will last from <span class="em">@(ViewBag.UmtFrom)</span> &rarr; <span class="em">@(ViewBag.UmtTo)</span> (GMT+8). Thanks for your patience!
        </p>
    </div>
    <script type="text/javascript">
        if (window.parent != window) {
            window.parent.location = location.href;
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
